MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Apps use '#include <yajl/yajl.h>' for includes historically.

Signed-off-by: Daniel P. BerrangĂ© <berrange@redhat.com>
---
